================================================================================
<===> error/nth_big/input.scss
@use "sass:list";
a {b: list.nth(10 20 30, 3000000000)}
<===> error/nth_big/error-libsass
Error: $n: Invalid index 3000000000 for a list with 3 elements.
  ,
2 | a {b: list.nth(10 20 30, 3000000000)}
  |       ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
  '
  input.scss 2:7  root stylesheet

